    "Game Center で実績・ランキングを見る" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "View Achievements & Leaderboards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game Center にサインインしていません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're Not Signed In"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone の「設定」＞「Game Center」からサインインすると、実績と世界のランキングを見られます。サインインしなくても、あそびはすべてそのまま遊べます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sign in from your device's Settings app to see achievements and worldwide leaderboards. Every game can still be played without signing in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」の非表示を元に戻す" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show %@ again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を元に戻しました" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を非表示にしました" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is hidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」を非表示にしました。元に戻せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is hidden. You can undo this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそび" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Games"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびごと" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By Game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびごとのベストスコア・最短タイム・勝敗と連勝を、遊んだ回数・勝った回数・遊んだあそびの種類・おすすめと評価のお願い・遊び方ガイドの表示履歴とあわせてこの端末に保存しています（送信はしません）。盤面や棋譜は残していません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each game's best score, fastest time, wins, losses and streaks are saved on this device, along with play and win counts, which games you've played, and the history of suggestions, rating requests, and how-to-play guides shown. None of this is sent anywhere. Board positions and move records aren't kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびば" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Asobiba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "あそびばアプリ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Asobiba"
