    "効果音" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sound Effects"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大富豪では、いま出せるカードを枠の色で目立たせ、出せない組を選んだときはその理由を1行で表示します。花札こいこいでは、取れる札を目立たせます。オフにすると何も表示しません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Daifugo, cards you can play are outlined in color, and if you pick a set you can't play, the reason appears in one line. In Hanafuda Koi-Koi, cards you can capture are highlighted. Turn this off to show nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
